DESCRIPTION:During Sports Day practice\, students participate in a variet
 y of physical activities\, team games\, relays\, and event rehearsals in
  preparation for Sports Day. They develop teamwork\, cooperation\, sport
 smanship\, and physical fitness while learning event procedures\, safety
  expectations\, and cheering routines. Practice sessions help students b
 uild confidence and ensure they are prepared to participate successfully
  in the Sports Day celebration.\n\nFor: ELC\nhttps://enishi.ac.jp/EISCom
 pass.html#/event/2026-11-04-elc-sports-day-rehearsal-1
